Package: rflexdid
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Difference-in-Differences with Staggered Treatment Timing
Version: 1.0.2.9001
Authors@R:
    person("Austin", "Craig", email = "austinrobertcraig@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R port of the Stata 'flexdid' command (Deb, Norton, Wooldridge,
    and Zabel 2025; SSC). Estimates a flexible OLS regression with cohort by
    group by time by treatment interactions for staggered-timing
    difference-in-differences designs, then aggregates the resulting
    cell-level effects to ATETs (overall, by exposure time, by calendar
    time, by cohort, by group, or by group X exposure time).
